---

The nodes are a layer over third-party color tools that are installed, not
redistributed here: OpenColorIO and the ACES config (Academy Software
Foundation), opencv-python-headless, tifffile, Pillow and numpy. Each keeps its
own license. ffmpeg is used as an external binary and is not bundled. See
ATTRIBUTION.md for the full table.
